  <reporting-org ref="GB-GOV-1" type="10">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UK - Foreign, Commonwealth Development Office (FCDO)</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing the regularity, granularity and impact assessment of conflict forecasts for policy makers</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will build on previous work for the FCDO and the experience at Conflict Forecast with requests from FCDO staff over the last three years. The proposed project will combine strengths of different violence data providers to develop a new suite of conflict forecasts, make the subnational forecasts explorable and downloadable with their conflict risk history on conflictforecast.org and maintain the new suite and development of new conflict damage forecasts based on economic impact case studies for the UK.</narrative>
  </description>
